[00:36.63] Plato's spawn cold ivied eyes
[00:42.80] Snare truth in bone and globe
[00:49.67] Harlequins coin pointless games
[00:55.76] Sneer jokes in parrot's robe
[01:01.85] Two women weep, Dame Scarlet Screen
[01:08.61] Sheds sudden theatre rain
[01:14.75] Whilst dark in dream the Midnight Queen
[01:21.11] Knows every human pain
[01:30.78] In Air, Fire, Earth and Water
[01:37.66] World on the scales
[01:44.08] Air, Fire, Earth and Water
[01:50.54] Balance of change
[01:56.88] World on the scales
[02:01.62] On the scales
[02:09.65] Bishop's kings spin judgement's blade
[02:15.76] Scratch faith on nameless graves
[02:22.42] Harvest hags hoard ash and sand
[02:28.55] Rack rope and chain for slaves
[02:34.35] Who fireside fear fermented words
[02:41.24] Then rear to spoil the feast
[02:47.39] Whilst in the aisle the mad man smiles
[02:54.25] To him it matters least...
[03:05.78] 
[04:52.19] Heroes hands drain stones for blood
[04:58.23] To whet the scaling knife
[05:05.04] Magi blind with visions light
[05:11.18] Net death in dread of life
[05:17.06] Their children kneel in Jesus till
[05:23.94] They learn the price of nails
[05:29.84] Whilst all around our Mother Earth
[05:36.49] Waits balanced on the scales
